    "headline": "ugust to kick off on a seasonably warm, humid and unsettled note",
    "dateLine": "11:30 a.m. Friday, July 31, 2026, Update",
    "excerpt": "In the wake of Tuesday's storm system, northwesterly winds of 12-25 mph ushered slightly cooler, drier and less humid air into the Lower Susquehanna Valley during the middle of the week. Morning sunshine \"self-destructed\" and gave way to afternoon clouds both Wednesday and Thursday, and high temperatures only reached the upper 70s to low 80s each afternoon. …",
